sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant C as Client App
    participant A as Auth Server
    participant R as Resource API
    U->>C: Click "Sign in"
    C->>A: GET /authorize?client_id=...
    A-->>U: Login page
    U->>A: Credentials
    A-->>C: 302 redirect with code
    C->>A: POST /token (code)
    A-->>C: access_token
    C->>R: GET /me (Bearer token)
    alt token valid
        R-->>C: 200 profile
    else token expired
        R-->>C: 401
        C->>A: POST /token (refresh)
    end
    Note over C,R: tokens are never sent to the browser
